TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water (pH 7) with O2(g), allow goethite+gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -volume 1
    O2(g) -0.7
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox3.sel
    -high_precision true
END
